* Layout regression: BJT polarities, diode and grounded E-source opamp proxy.
* This is a structural drawing example, not a qualified simulation circuit.
.model QN NPN (bf=100)
.model QP PNP (bf=80)
.model DM D (is=1e-15)
VDD vdd 0 5
VIN in 0 0.7
R1 vdd c1 10k
Q1 c1 in 0 QN
Q2 c2 in vdd QP
R2 c2 0 10k
D1 c1 clamp DM
R3 clamp 0 100k
E1 out 0 c1 c2 100
R4 out 0 1k
.end

